### UI and HUD

#### Guidelines
- Maintain CRT aesthetic (pixelated fonts, limited colors)
- Keep UI elements non-intrusive (no blocking critical play area)
- Test at 320x180 resolution (elements must be readable)
- Respect integer scaling (no sub-pixel positioning)

```gdscript
# ✅ GOOD: Integer positioning for pixel-perfect rendering
$ScoreLabel.position = Vector2(
    floori($ScoreLabel.position.x),
    floori($ScoreLabel.position.y)
)
```

